objdll: RELs from the game module's overlay table
omDLLLink finds the REL by name in the generated table, restores its pristine .data and zeroes its .bss, and calls its ObjectSetup. No windows.h in game code.
Applied in order by runtimes/gc_wii/mp4/CMakeLists.txt with `git apply`.

